      "description": "Beige and gray-yellow crystal that has a wicked jaggedness to its shape shines dully in the shadowy light of the forested basin that the Cie'th dwells in. Its perpetual sadness is expressed in alien crying that sounds almost like that of a mother having lost a child.- Manly Man"
